  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mTsoUZD.png\" width=\"880\" height=\"248\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组添加了（几乎）愚人节快照 24w14potato 中的所有新增内容，包括新维度、Boss 和结构！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">游戏内截图：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M7FwC6M.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"853\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u8OtFDI.png\" width=\"855\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WYHrgDv.jpeg\" width=\"853\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kNUMp8W.png\" width=\"853\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">开启着色器后：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/bsl-shaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSL Shaders</a> <span style=\"font-size:10px\">+</span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/distant-horizons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Distant Horizons</a> <span style=\"font-size:10px\">+</span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irisshaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Shaders</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:10px\">+</span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a></span></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U1psumY.jpeg\" width=\"853\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JHLVXhS.jpeg\" width=\"853\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z8SnuIq.jpeg\" width=\"853\" height=\"480\"></p>\n&nbsp;\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DD6E2W5.jpeg\" width=\"853\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mo0kDMl.jpeg\" width=\"853\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sY8wRg6.jpeg\" width=\"855\" height=\"444\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7DqmmvV.jpeg\" width=\"855\" height=\"444\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">与原版快照的区别：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><del>Floatater 无法正常工作</del></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">游戏菜单的启动标语尚未替换</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">地形生成存在细微差异</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">毒树脂相关机制已实现在由普通箭袋制作台合成的“特殊箭袋制作台”中</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">传送门功能存在非关键性差异</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与 MegaSpud 的 Boss 战中，犰狳已被替换为山羊（适用于 1.21 以下版本）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>本模组的 Fabric 版本需要 Fabric API<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">。</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您发现了任何 <em>Bug</em>，或者发现快照原版中存在但本模组缺失的内容，请在模组页面评论区或 <del>GitHub。</del> 留言反馈。</span></strong></p>",
